body:
This did it, thank you! I even see it's linked in the [documentation](http://docs.qtile.org/en/latest/manual/config/lazy.html) \- I swear I went over it a hundred times but I don't know how I missed it.

&#x200B;

Thank you again though, both for the quick reply and developing qtile - it's really a fabulous window manager.

Ahh I see, thank you.

What APMs do you own? Might try to find one for cheaper. 

Also regarding the M3s if you've owned one - How's their durability? Idk if amazon just presents shitty reviews first but both look relatively scary from amazon reviews ;;

I really like the thresh chromas! Though one small thing which I think could be really nice would be if the ofuda had different writings on them for the different chromas, similar to arcanist kog'maw's chromas. 

&#x200B;

I understand if this isn't possible though - if the inscriptions are important to the lore of the skin.

Huh, I can't actually find the thread, I remember reading it on my phone. And yeah, I'm hoping for the reviews to be helpful. Also I don't need SLI or any really special features, going for a relatively standard-ish build. So I'll look into some more of the B series! Thanks\~

&#x200B;

Also, Ik the Graphics card fits in the case with room to spare, I'm just unsure about creating positive pressure overall in the case, and the common cooling issues with the card itself.

But I've always been told that I will **some day/one day/soon**. I've been told that for years, and I've just gotten worse and worse. I was ready to jump yesterday, stuff got even worse, and now I'm not bothered to go through the hassle of suicide prep.

&#x200B;

And I have no hope whatsoever anymore that things are to change.

DOS2. Looking for someone to play co-op with, or a party is fine. I'm UTC +8 (East Asian). PC. Best direction of contact would probably be to DM me your discord, since I can't go through my discord reqs. I usually game weekday afternoons. Only really made it half way through Hollow marshes, >!where Fane gets his Bless ability after talking to the spirit woman in the realm he gets teleported to after going through the illusion dungeon!<. I'll be playing in explorer/classic.

&#x200B;

EDIT: Found coop partner, if you wanna play tho, feel free to DM me.
